{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has fallen before the machines. Now, a warrior equipped with special armor rises as the last hope to reclaim the lost world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast and fluid 2D side-scroller combat. Dodge, attack, and use special abilities to overcome relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colossal Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face giant enemies, each with unique attack patterns and electrifying battle phases. Prepare for challenges that will test your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore landscapes devastated by AIs: ruined cities, industrial factories, frozen complexes, and volcanic zones. Each stage brings new dangers and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of humanity depends on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take back the world from the machines?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980920?t=1774493148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/29df876c927105b5af9f2afa6dbb0cc60ed1d2db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774493148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/7fc1536c32736f9e1eb2b36ee321da46cc69e442/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774493148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/7fc1536c32736f9e1eb2b36ee321da46cc69e442/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774493148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":2